# fix1 round 2, flow "fix1_monsters" run 3 (test database, homelands on, real time): the level-10 Kargan
# warrior "Buzcu" in Demirağız walks up to the two reshaped homeland monsters - Kırağı Kayası (ice-spiked
# boulder) and Donuk Ocakçı (horned frost guard) - lets each come and strike, then kills it.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text fix1_monsters
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars2 900
clickon select.slot1
wait 5
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+zone3 1800
expect world+level10
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 600

# ---- Kırağı Kayası ----
scene walkpath 240 292
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
waitfor world+monsters 600
scene walktomonster Kırağı Kayası 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene target nearest Kırağı Kayası
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 20
screenshot 32_demiragiz_rime_rock_1_idle.png
scene walktomonster Kırağı Kayası 4
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
waitfor world+hitstaken1 1200
scene camera side 18 6
wait 4
screenshot 32_demiragiz_rime_rock_2_attack.png
scene target nearest Kırağı Kayası
key f
waitfor world+kills1 3600
wait 30
scene camera side 24 6
wait 5
screenshot 32_demiragiz_rime_rock_3_death.png

# ---- Donuk Ocakçı (the west basin) ----
scene walkpath 172 258
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
scene walktomonster Donuk Ocakçı 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene target nearest Donuk Ocakçı
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 20
screenshot 33_demiragiz_frozen_hearthguard_1_idle.png
scene walktomonster Donuk Ocakçı 4
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
waitfor world+hitstaken2 1200
scene camera side 18 6
wait 4
screenshot 33_demiragiz_frozen_hearthguard_2_attack.png
scene target nearest Donuk Ocakçı
key f
waitfor world+kills2 3600
wait 30
scene camera side 24 6
wait 5
screenshot 33_demiragiz_frozen_hearthguard_3_death.png
quit
